## 1. Executive Summary

This audit assesses the readiness of ClimateGuard AI's codebase to support an operational urban heat-risk prediction model for Chennai. The data ingestion pipeline and quality validator (Phase A and Phase B) are fully operational with 15 passing automated tests. This audit establishes what risk calculations and modeling logic currently exist, identifies genuine local data availability, documents the existing risk formula, details missing satellite and demographic datasets, and recommends the next safe implementation step.

